# pytest's compiled test modules. Deliberately NOT a blanket `__pycache__/` or
# `*.pyc`: this repo already tracks four ordinary bytecode files
# (src/__pycache__/setup_screen.cpython-313.pyc and three under src/utils/), and
# a blanket rule would hide them. pytest tags its own output with `-pytest-<ver>`,
# which none of the tracked files carry.
*-pytest-*.pyc
